normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622eb"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622ec", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e2fbdc66f9ce3f243b5676"], "concepts": ["60e5671a499d1e49588f87db"], "question": {"text": "The correct sequence of acidic strength of the following aliphatic acids in their decreasing order is: \\(\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH}, \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}, \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH}, \\mathrm{HCOOH}\\)"}, "options": [{"id": "513769", "text": "\\(\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{HCOOH}\\)", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622ed"}, {"id": "7ca65e", "text": "\\(\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{HCOOH}\\)", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622ee"}, {"id": "314d81", "text": "\\(\\mathrm{HCOOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH}\\)", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622ef"}, {"id": "57036d", "text": "\\(\\mathrm{HCOOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{COOH} > \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{COOH}\\)", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f0"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f1", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e567fc499d1e49588fa045"], "concepts": ["60e40fd4f1ef260f84ed1e69"], "question": {"text": "Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as<br />Assertion (A): A simple distillation can be used to separate a mixture of propanol and propanone.<br />Reason (R): Two liquids with a difference of more than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in their boiling points can be separated by simple distillations.<br />In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :"}, "options": [{"id": "e47cf7", "text": "Both (A) and (R) are correct but (R) is not the correct explanation of (A).", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f2"}, {"id": "05415b", "text": "Both (A) and (R) are correct and (R) is the correct explanation of (A).", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f3"}, {"id": "e8986a", "text": "(A) is true but (R) is false.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f4"}, {"id": "c84fea", "text": "(A) is false but (R) is true.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f5"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f6", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e56814499d1e49588fa3a9"], "concepts": ["6162fbac6ed13040ec851b25"], "question": {"text": "Designate whether each of the following compounds is aromatic or not aromatic.<br /><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2FPQEs1eDli_kH_kaknAe3EQ1vX6vcnzv6lYEz6_l2yaM.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"/><br/>"}, "options": [{"id": "00bbae", "text": "\\(e, g\\) aromatic and \\(a, b, c, d, f, h\\) not aromatic", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f7"}, {"id": "334849", "text": "\\(b, e, f, g\\) aromatic and \\(a, c, d, h\\) not aromatic", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f8"}, {"id": "9ab563", "text": "\\(a, b, c, d\\) aromatic and \\(e, f, g, h\\) not aromatic", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622f9"}, {"id": "3d5a7e", "text": "\\(a, c, d, e, h\\) aromatic and \\(b, f, g\\) not aromatic", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622fa"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622fb", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4787"], "concepts": ["60e2fb9d66f9ce3f243b52de"], "question": {"text": "Among the following compounds, geometrical isomerism is exhibited by :"}, "options": [{"id": "194e89", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2Ff083c4f7-4c51-44a5-95fc-972f50a338bf-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 94px; height: 181px;\" />", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622fc"}, {"id": "de401e", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2Fff1c6cd9-ef90-4c6d-b7f9-e4ad52c5083b-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 139px; height: 158px;\" />", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622fd"}, {"id": "7f03ea", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F1a72d93c-510e-44c4-b8ba-02e229590ea4-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 193px; height: 158px;\" />", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622fe"}, {"id": "32a02f", "text": "<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2Fd0dd8720-8c08-4f29-bdfd-2a0959c0c299-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 93px; height: 138px;\" />", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d92622ff"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f492ee0e063d9262300", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfaf4"], "topics": ["60e567ac499d1e495